     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">I checked the gitbook version of this book&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">Advanced Spatial Modeling with Stochastic Partial Differential Equations Using R and INLA&quot;</span> in the link you posted. <br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">In chapter 7, when I use this code</span></font></div><div><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><br></span></font></div><div><pre><code><a rel=\"nofollow\">x.k &lt;-<span> </span><span>book.rspde</span>(coords, <span>range =</span> <span>sqrt</span>(<span>8</span>) <span>/</span><span> </span>params[<span>2</span>], </a>\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\">  <span>sigma =</span> <span>sqrt</span>(params[<span>1</span>]), <span>n =</span> k, <span>mesh =</span> prmesh1,</a>\r\n  <span>return.attributes =</span> <span>TRUE</span>)<br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">I get error message </font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(204,0,0)\">&quot;Error in book.rspde(coords, range = sqrt(8)/params[2], sigma = sqrt(params[1]),  : <br>  could not find function &quot;book.rspde&quot;</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:verdana,sans-serif\">I tried to install all libraries and packages I could ever think of, but I still get the same error message. <br>Any help please regarding this error?</span><br><br></code></pre></div></div>"
